message: "If you use this software or its coaching rules in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Home Gym: a self hosted AI workout coach for home gyms"
abstract: >-
  Self hosted training app that writes and adapts strength programs from the equipment a person actually owns,
  using double progression, block periodisation with deloads and an AI model constrained by fixed rules.
type: software
authors:
